capability record/rarer-kinds  the rarer kinds read by their fields: NSEC3, NSEC3PARAM, CDS, CDNSKEY, URI, LOC, CERT, OPENPGPKEY, ZONEMD and the obsolete ones
  heroes  pending
  go      -
  rust    rdata::NSEC3, rdata::NSEC3PARAM, rdata::CDS, rdata::CDNSKEY, rdata::OPENPGPKEY, rdata::CERT
