capability client/srv  the servers of a service, by priority
  heroes  dns.lookup_srv, dns.Srv
  go      net.LookupSRV, net.Resolver.LookupSRV, net.SRV
  rust    Resolver::srv_lookup
  python  resolve(name, "SRV")
  note    Ordered by priority, then by weight from the largest, where Go draws by weight at random (RFC 2782); a program that wants the draw has the weights

