  rust    hickory_resolver::ResolveError, hickory_proto::ProtoError, and the traits each type repeats
  python  dns.exception.DNSException, dns.exception.FormError, dns.exception.Timeout, dns.resolver.NXDOMAIN, dns.resolver.NoAnswer, dns.resolver.NoNameservers, dns.resolver.LifetimeTimeout, dns.name.BadPointer, dns.message.TrailingJunk

